  "classMaskRenderCheck": {
    "finding": "FIXED (commit e561242). The colour-mode select() materialised `cls` and the segment-id byte inside its branches (nodeVar5 under mode==2, nodeVar7 under mode==3) while the size term read them outside, so every point took class 0's / segment 0's bit: hiding a class did nothing, hiding class 0 or soloing blanked the view, and class masks looked correct in class colour mode only. The mask now reads its own class byte and segment id.",
    "observedOn": "height colour mode at 2M: hide every class -> empty canvas; hide class 6 -> buildings gone; solo class 6 -> buildings only",
    "guard": "__pcv.shaderWgsl() + the mask codegen check in scripts/bench.md",
    "screenshots": [
      ".playwright-mcp/p7-fix-hide-all-classes.png",
      ".playwright-mcp/p7-fix-hide-buildings.png",
      ".playwright-mcp/p7-fix-solo-buildings.png"
    ]
  },
